## API for Programmatic Use

The CLI can be used programmatically:

```typescript
import { createApp, sync } from 'pika-app';

// Create a new app
await createApp({
    name: 'my-app',
    template: 'default',
    directory: './my-app',
    skipInstall: false,
    skipGit: false
});

// Sync framework
await sync({
    version: 'latest',
    dryRun: false,
    force: false
});
```

{% aside type="note" title="Programmatic API" %}
The programmatic API is primarily for tool integrations. Most users should use the CLI commands directly.
{% /aside %}

